Feeling sick in Japan? Say these 3 words to get help 🏥
Save this. You'll hope you never need it.

Today's phrases:
• きぶんが わるいです (kibun ga warui desu) = I don't feel well
• あたま (atama) = Head
• ねつ (netsu) = Fever

